      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Two trucks share each canoe. Each person paddles one station: forward/reverse
    strokes with drive; steer changes stroke angle; ACTION braces and rights a capsized
    canoe. Paddle together for synchronized strokes; opposite strokes turn the boat.
    A missing partner is AI and follows your cadence. Follow numbered river gates
    to the finish. Capsizes cost20; fastest completed canoe wins. Team Paddle Challenge
    rewards synchronization and accurate gates. Both seated players share their canoe''s
    result.'
